WEBVTT

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.250
Beastmen strive to become stronger by Evolving.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.630
They take great pride in Evolution.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:19.210
Fran's parents took their daughter with them
on their journey to Evolve.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:25.790
But no Black Cat has ever been able to Evolve.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:33.460
Fran's parents were no luckier. Their journey
came to an end before their reached their goal.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:39.920
Now, Fran sets out to fulfill their dream of Evolution...

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:46.210
...by doing all she can to grow strong and powerful!

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:47.960
Plus...

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.210
...Fran's got a knack for battle.

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:00.630
Sword Art: Triple Thrust!

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>Name: Fran</b>

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.330
<b> Age: 12</b>

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.330
<b> Race: Beastman, Black Cat</b>

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>Class: None</b>

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>VIT:</b>

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>INT:</b>

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>STR:</b>

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>AGI:</b>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:12.580
Whether it's sword arts or magic skills,
a little teaching's all it takes for her to master 'em.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>Skills: Sword Mastery 1, Darkvision,</b>

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>Expert Butcher,</b>

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:08.330
<b>Wayfinder</b>

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:11.210
Create Water.

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:17.750
You're dirty, too, Teacher.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:21.250
But more than anything Fran's such a sweet kid!

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.580
I'm so glad I have an amazing girl like her as my wielder!

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:31.250
I'm gonna dedicate my life—my NEW life—
to making her strong and powerful!

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:37.130
Fran, what is it?

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.710
Hey! Say something!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:17.000
Dammit! Stay back! Get out of here!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.960
<b>EPISODE 2:</b>

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.960
<b>THE HELLISH TRIAL AT THE ADVENTURER'S GUILD</b>

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.830
You didn't say we'd encounter goblins on this route!

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:22.880
Get rid of them, Randell!

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.380
How'm I supposed to-?

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.040
Gross!

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:31.630
Double Slash.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:35.830
I got 'em!

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:45.380
Sword Art: Aura Blade. Creates a blade of mana
without needing to draw me.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.460
It's not that powerful, but it's good for surprise attacks.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.250
Okay, got it.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.500
Thank the gods...

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:00.380
Fran, don't tell anyone I'm a talking sword.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:04.210
You're the only one who can hear my telepathy.

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:05.250
Okay.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:07.000
Thank you so much!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:11.290
Could I thank you by giving you a ride?
We're headed to the city of Alessa.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:12.880
You are?

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.460
Sounds like he wants you to guard his carriage.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:21.130
Might as well take him up on the offer.
He seems like a stand-up guy.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.580
Sure, I can keep you safe on the way to the city.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:29.000
Oh, boy... Saw right through me, didn't you?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:39.460
In the last month, some trouble on the Greatwolf Plain
has the monsters all riled up.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.210
Where's the Greatwolf Plain?

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.790
It's an A-rank Haunt to the east.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.670
I'm guessing some tough monsters
were having a turf war,

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:57.460
cause a bunch of weaker ones like goblins
have been spotted close to busy roads.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:00.500
That was the Greatwolf Plain?
Guess that means this trouble was my fault...

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:07.170
Stories say the Plain is where
the S-rank monster Fenrir died.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:14.880
People think the reason only weak monsters spawn there
is 'cause his mana still lingers.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.960
Oh, so that's why the further out I went,
the stronger they got.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:23.130
Fenrir, though. Damn...

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:27.540
Do you know anything about a sword
in the center of that plain?

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.830
Ooh, nice one, Fran! He might know about me!

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:32.790
Can't say I do.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:34.210
Aw, man.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:40.500
I know they're only a G-rank threat,
but you took those goblins out like they were nothing.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:44.170
I'd say you were an E-Rank Adventurer. I guess right?

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.630
G-rank threat?

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:46.920
Adventurer?!

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:50.790
Huh? You've never heard that before? Oh, boy.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:56.250
Each monster has a threat rank
that tells you how dangerous they are.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:01.880
There are people who take requests
to hunt those monsters. We call them...

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.380
Adventurers!

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.380
That's right.

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:10.710
Adventurers go from legendary
S-Ranks to newbie G-ranks.

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:15.000
You might've heard of famous A-ranks
like Forlund of the Hundred Swords,

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.830
or Amanda the Great Mother.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.790
Adventurers are so cool...

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.040
How do you become one?

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.080
Oh?

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:27.380
You just have to register at the Adventurer's Guild.

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:30.580
The Guild will also appraise and buy materials
obtained from slain monsters.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:36.790
That means we can earn us some money.
You're gonna be eating well, Fran!

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:39.420
I want money...

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.210
Don't be ridiculous.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.630
A weak Black Cat girl could never be an adventurer.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.500
Look at this sleepyhead.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:05.170
Not that I blame her. She was up late last night
practicing Skills and butchering monsters.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:11.750
Teacher's cooking... Makes even grilled meat yummy...

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:11.750
Can kids just up and become adventurers here, though?

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:31.420
That's the city of Alessa.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.540
I'll pay for you to enter the city.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:36.880
Randell, you're so nice!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.080
Here we are, Fran! Your first time...

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.290
...in a city!

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.920
See her with that big-ass sword?

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.170
Wow, what a joke.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:58.000
First off, let's hit up the Adventurer's Guild.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:58.830
Okay!

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.330
So these are the guild adventurers...

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.750
They've got all sorts of weapons.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:11.250
Meh, none of them are as rare as me, though.
Let's check 'em out with Identify!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:15.790
<b>Name: Tempered Steel Longsword</b>

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:15.790
<b>Attack:</b>

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:15.790
<b>MP:</b>

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:15.790
<b>HP:</b>

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.790
<b>Mana Conductivity:</b>

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:15.710
Mm-hmm, Attack: 398.

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:17.790
Huh?!

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.290
<b>Name: Mythril Greatsword</b>

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.290
<b>Attack:</b>

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.290
<b>MP:</b>

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.290
<b>HP:</b>

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.290
<b>Mana Conductivity:</b>

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.290
<b>Skills: None</b>

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:20.080
423...

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.790
That one, and that one too...

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.790
<b>Attack</b>

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:32.830
I thought I was super rare,
but everyone's swords are way stronger than me!

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:27.290
<b>Attack</b>

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:33.790
Teacher...

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:37.290
You're amazing, Teacher. You saved me!

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.790
And you're real pretty, too.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:42.790
You have lots of skills. No other sword could compare!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.000
Thank you, Fran.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.580
<i>No, thank you.</i>

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.630
Fran is such a sweetheart.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.460
That's it! I'm gonna support Fran with all my Skills!

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:57.540
That's my new purpose in life!

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:57.330
<b>ADVENTURER'S GUILD</b>

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.830
Piss off and die.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:06.670
I know you can hear me, four-eyes!

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.830
Piss off and die.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.710
Screw that bitch. Cheap-ass miser.

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.880
Ex-mercenary trash.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.000
They can all piss off and die.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.460
Oh, shoot! I need to smile, c'mon!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:27.290
Bad day or not, I have to be Nell,
smiling receptionist of the Adventurer's...

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.290
'Scuse me!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.790
Um...

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.130
This is the Adventurer's Guild, hun.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:36.080
I know. I wanna be an adventurer.

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:43.880
She's just a child, and adventuring is dangerous.
She wouldn't last five minutes.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:49.080
Okay, but we don't let just anyone register with us.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:49.670
Okay.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:53.420
You'd have to fight our examiner in a mock battle.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.080
Okay.

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:57.540
And you might get hurt.

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:00.960
Our guild will not take responsibility
for any injuries incurred.

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.170
Got it.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:07.130
She's just another kid who needs to learn a hard lesson...

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.170
This way, then.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:17.380
Damn, this is more legit than I thought.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.750
You the person wantin' to register?

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.750
I'm the official examiner for Alessa's Adventurer's Guild.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:32.790
THE GREAT AND POWERFUL DONADROND!

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:40.630
Donadrond sure does make his fellow Ogres proud
with his intense Intimidation.

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:46.330
Most would-be recruits turn tail and run when they're hit
with his Intimidation skill, let alone fight him.

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:50.330
That's the first trial that weeds out
anyone who doesn't have what it takes.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:51.920
Huh?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.080
She's not affected by his Intimidation!

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:56.210
Fran, you all right?

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:56.830
Yeah.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.000
Let's Identify this guy.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Skills: Intimidate 4, Transport 3,</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Incresed Recovery Speed 5</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Increased Health Regen 4, Instruction 4,</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Regen 5, Blink 6, Earth Magic 2,</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Throwing Weapons 4, Poison Resistance 7, Woodcutting 3,</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Axe Arts 6, Axe Mastery 7, Roar 3,</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Revive, Spirit Manipulation, Muscles of Steel,</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Auto Health Regen, Strength Up 1</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Equipment: Blacksteel Battleaxe, Blacksteel Tortoise Armor,</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Sabre-Tooth Mantle, Stone Dragon Boots,</b>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Armband of Sacrifice</b>

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Name: Donadrond</b>

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Age: 46</b>

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Race: Ogre</b>

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>Class: Warrior</b>

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>VIT:</b>

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.540
<b>INT:</b>

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.420
Donadrond the Ogre, eh?

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.420
That's a lotta Ds.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.540
Hold up.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.750
<b>Skills:            Intimidate 4, Transport 3,</b>

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.750
<b>Incresed Recovery Speed 5</b>

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.750
<b>Increased Health Regen 4, Instruction 4,</b>

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.750
<b>Regen 5,           Blink 6,          Earth Magic 2,</b>

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.750
<b>Throwing Weapons 4, Poison Resistance 7, Woodcutting 3,</b>

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:07.170
This guy is crazy strong...

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.040
<b>Axe Arts 6, Axe Mastery 7, Roar 3,</b>

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.040
<b>Revive,            Spirit Manipulation,       Muscles of Steel,</b>

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.040
<b>Auto Health Regen,                   Strength Up 1</b>

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.040
<b>Equipment:               Blacksteel Battleaxe,                   Blacksteel Tortoise Armor,</b>

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.040
<b>Sabre-Tooth Mantle, Stone Dragon Boots,</b>

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.040
<b>Armband of Sacrifice</b>

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:12.040
<b>Name: Blacksteel Battleaxe</b>

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:12.040
<b>Attack:</b>

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:12.040
<b>MP:</b>

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:12.040
<b>HP:</b>

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:12.040
<b>Mana Conductivity:</b>

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:12.040
Attack: 650?!

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:14.420
That's not important, Teacher.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:15.790
I know.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.790
I don't like holding back.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.460
I'll come at you with all I got!

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:24.170
I'd like that.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.330
Fran, he's definitely the toughest guy you've faced yet.

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:32.210
Don't you hold back either, okay?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.000
Okay.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:36.210
Let the test begin!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.580
That little thing went in to take the test!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:43.380
Bet she lost in two seconds flat.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:47.330
Here he comes!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:54.790
You dodged!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:58.540
That was close!

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.170
Fran!

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:05.080
Slam Smash!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:10.290
Nice, Fran! Good dodge!

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.210
Power Swing!

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:24.580
Watch out!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.670
He's going way too hard on her!

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:31.580
I'll keep Fran safe!

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.830
You used your sword to weaken the blow.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:42.580
Fran, don't take his attacks head-on with me!

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:45.040
But I can't just keep running away!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:48.040
You're right. Lemme cast a buff on you.

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:49.670
It'll improve your attack power!

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:50.420
Okay!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.460
Teacher cast a support spell.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:58.670
Fran's STR and AGI have temporarily increased.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.540
That's a high-level sword you got there.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.380
But it's not enough!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.330
His wounds are healing!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.380
Donadrond don't stop!

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:17.880
I want...

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.580
...to be an adventurer!

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:27.130
What?! Earth magic?!

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.670
Leave the magic to me!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.130
Fire Spell!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.130
Tri Explosion!

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:39.670
No way... She cast several spells
without speaking them aloud?!

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:43.380
And that was a high-level fire spell just now!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:45.630
I'll finish this.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:48.580
Sword Art!

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.330
Dragon Fang!

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:06.130
She built up to that huge Sword Art
while also casting all those spells?!

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:09.670
She couldn't do that without having at least
two heads to think at once!

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:13.290
I've never seen even high-rank adventurers fight like that!

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:15.880
Do I pass?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:21.170
Um, yes, it looks like it.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.040
She beat me good!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:29.130
<b>GUILD MASTER: KLIMT</b>

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:29.630
A loss is no laughing matter, Donadrond.

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:31.880
Uh! Sorry, sir.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:33.710
Right then, Miss Fran.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:37.080
Only twelve years of age,
but already using mid-tier Sword Arts,

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:40.790
and casting Level 10 fire spells
without saying the encantation aloud...

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.000
Wherever did you learn-

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:42.880
I'm not telling.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:43.880
I see...

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:47.630
Don't tell anyone about us and what we can do.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:53.960
If the wrong person finds out,
they might use it to spot our weakness.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:56.080
My lips are sealed.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.960
Good grief... Very well.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.460
Identify.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.960
You have Identity Protection, too?

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:10.000
Glad I used my Evolution Points on that one.
Knew we'd need it!

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.330
Are you gonna turn me down?

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:19.830
No, you pass. A few things still don't quite
make sense, but the spirits are calm.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:20.880
Spirits?

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:24.250
Yes, they're very sensitive
to ill intentions or dark thoughts.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:29.920
I can use them to tell if you harbor any ill will
towards us or others.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Skills: Swiftcast 7, Identify 5, Boy Mastery 3,</b>

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Gathering 5, Wood Magic 7,</b>

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Spirit Magic 8, Greater Earth Magic 6,</b>

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Alchemy 5, Earth Magic 10, Poison Resistance 3,</b>

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Paralysis Resistance 4, Water Magic 5,</b>

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Herbology 7, Cooking 4, Mana Manipulation</b>

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Child of the forest</b>

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Unique Skill: Favor of the Spirits</b>

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Titles:          Guild Master, Guardian of Alessa</b>

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Name: Klimt</b>

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Age: 136</b>

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Race: Wood Elf</b>

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>Class: Spirit Sorcerer</b>

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>VIT:</b>

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>INT:</b>

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>STR:</b>

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:36.880
<b>AGI:</b>

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.670
He can use Spirit Magic...

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:36.880
And has tons of high-level skills.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:40.380
Everything is in order.

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:44.540
Issue her a guild card.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.790
Touch this crystal, please.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:53.960
It will record your mana signature.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.080
You'll also need to pick a class.

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.290
What's a class?

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:02.630
A class gives you different skills and abilities.

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:06.290
You should choose a class
that gives you the powers you're seeking.

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.960
The classes available to you are...

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:10.290
Huh?

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:16.080
Fighter, Swordsman, Spellword, Summoner...
And so many more!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.540
You have so many possibilities!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.920
Shoot, I might be sharing too many skills with her...

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:28.790
This is absolutely insane...
Though I suppose I shouldn't be surprised anymore.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:32.000
A Spellsword sounds cool.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:36.290
Why not grab it, then? Looks like you can use
both Sword Arts and spells that way.

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:37.880
I'll be a Spellword!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:42.710
Wielder Fran's class is now Spellsword.

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:46.920
And that's that. Here is your guild card.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.880
I'm an adventurer!

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:53.880
Something else you need?

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:58.170
I see. You'd like to sell us materials, then?

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:00.830
I gotta or I won't have money for a room.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.580
Ah, yes...

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.960
Okay, Fran. Let's pull some stuff
out of our Pocket Dimension.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:09.170
Pretend you're grabbing it from your item bag.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:09.880
Okay.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:18.960
We'll stick with low and mid-rank stuff for now.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:22.580
Y-you butchered and prepared these yourself?!

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:23.290
Uh-huh.

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:26.500
Wow, uh, p-please give me a moment!

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.790
Your total payment comes out to 195,000 gold.

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:36.250
I've never seen so much gold before...

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:40.380
From the prices I saw in the market,
one gold is around 10 yen...

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:43.540
So we just made 1.9 million yen?! Holy shit!

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:49.500
Some materials came from F-Rank monsters,
and they were butchered extremely cleanly.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.920
Thanks, lady. I can get a room now.

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:56.080
Please, call me Nell, Miss Fran.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.920
Okay. Thanks, Nell.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:03.210
Sweet, let's go find us a room!

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:04.330
Okay.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.460
Hold up there.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:12.170
Fran, just pretend you don't hear 'em.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:13.040
Mm-kay.

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.830
HEY, YOU!

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:17.040
We told you to hold up!

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:20.380
You hear us, you little twerp?!

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:20.960
What?

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:25.380
You didn't earn that fair and square, did ya?

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:28.170
What? The hell are they talking about?

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:29.420
You reek!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:34.250
I do not. I took a bath in the river this morning.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.540
Gross!

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:37.290
Way to contaminate the water!

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:41.500
Underhanded shit's the only way
a stinky cat like you could get by!

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:43.500
This shit again?

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:47.880
Is this what Fran has to put up with all the time?

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:49.380
Fran...

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:55.000
We just sold a bunch of Twin-Headed Bear
shit, too, for cheap change!

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.750
That means you had to have done something dirty.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:01.750
You make some kinda deal with that
four-eyed bitch over there, huh?!

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:04.130
Four-eyed bitch?

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:09.330
Give us what you made and we'll let you
and your underhanded shit slide.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.830
Nothing underhanded took place in either transaction.

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:17.290
The materials you sold were badly damaged
and improperly butchered,

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:21.080
likely as a result of ganging up on the creature
and wailing upon it until it died.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:23.380
And what's so wrong about that?

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:27.290
Adventurers who wish to sell materials for high prices

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:31.710
must slay the creature properly
and carefully dissect the materials!

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:36.920
Adventurers who use their own ignorance
as pretext for robbery...

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:39.920
...should piss off and die.

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:42.790
What?

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:45.830
Did you just tell us to piss off and die?!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:46.460
Huh?

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.580
Dammit, Nell, you said it out loud this time!

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.830
You arrogant bitch...

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:54.040
Time for you to die instead!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.460
I won't let you lay a finger on her.

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:00.000
Miss Fran...

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:04.630
Weak chickenshit beastman...
You dare talk back to a Red Dog?!

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.130
Can I stab him?

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:09.380
Whoa, you probably shouldn't
pull me on him inside the guild.

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:12.250
We're ex-mercenaries!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:18.170
We ate kids like you for breakfast on the battlefield.

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:19.670
They're blocking the way out...

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:23.000
We'll beat the shit out of you then sell you to a slaver.

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:27.380
Not sure anyone will wanna buy
a Black Cat that stinks worse than shit, though.

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:32.420
Wha...?

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.880
My feet! My fucking feet!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.920
Huh? I didn't do anything.

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:41.580
Don't insult Black Cats.

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.170
Wait, was that Fran?!

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:49.040
I didn't unsheathe you.
I used Vibrofang to sharpen my Aura Blade.

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:53.670
For real? She put those two together that fast...

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:55.290
You bitch!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.670
Damn Black Cat!

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.580
We'll tear you to pieces!

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:02.130
Oscillation.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.790
Y-you...

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:14.250
Good job, Fran. Oscillation destroys them
from the inisde out. He's not getting up anytime soon.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:14.960
Yup.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.630
Nice going, kid!

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.170
Good shit!

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:19.960
Good job, Fran.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:21.380
Good job, my ass!

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:24.420
Call the guard! Arrest this little shit!

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.580
What? That was clearly an act of self-defense.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:30.460
Despite being a "four-eyed bitch,"
it was clear as day to me.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:34.380
Though we will need you to pay to clean up this mess.

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:35.960
100,000 gold will do.

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:39.790
We won't provide healing services
until that bill is paid. Understood?

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:43.170
Fran, we should try not to piss off Nell.

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:44.000
Yeah.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:45.830
I'll handle the rest.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:48.540
Okay. Thanks, Nell.

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:54.000
All right, let's find us a bed and buy you some new gear!

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:56.130
Gear? I want gear!

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.750
You can't deceive my Godsight.

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:03.580
That's an Intelligent Weapon.

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:40.420
<b>NEXT EPISODE:</b>

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:40.420
<b>THE GRIZZLED OLD BLACKSMITH</b>
